graph TD
    User["业务代码"] -->|声明实现| Annotation["AutoService 注解"]
    User -->|load / diagnose| Loader["ServiceLoader<T>"]
    Annotation -.->|编译期元数据| Implementation["服务实现类"]
    Registry["生成的 ServiceRegistry"] -->|静态注册| RegEntry["ServiceSupplier: alias + factory"]
    Loader -->|type + alias| Registry
    Registry -->|过滤并返回有序工厂| Factory["ServiceFactory<T>"]
    RegEntry --> Factory
    Factory -->|非全局单例，每次 load 包装| Lazy["ServiceLazy<T>"]
    Factory -->|singleton=true 直接复用| Singleton["SingletonServiceSupplier<T>"]
    Lazy -->|首次 get 创建，loader 内复用| Implementation
    Singleton -->|首次 get 创建，全局复用| Implementation
    Loader -->|diagnose| Diagnostics["生成的 ServiceRegistryDiagnostics"]
    Diagnostics -->|构造| Report["ServiceDiagnosticReport"]
    Report -->|包含 0..n| DiagEntry["ServiceDiagnosticEntry"]
    DiagEntry -->|状态| Status["REGISTERED / EXCLUDED"]
    Report -->|可用性| Availability["ServiceDiagnosticAvailability"]
